OL,3,GNEWSAEight people injured after car
OL,4,A'mounts pavement' in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight people have been injured after
OL,7,Fthey were struck by a car in the west
OL,8,Fend of Glasgow.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(SFRS) said two were taken to hospital
OL,12,Fand six were treated at the scene
OL,13,Ffollowing the incident, which happened
OL,14,Fat about 15:45 on Hyndland Road.
OL,16,FUnconfirmed reports suggest the vehicle
OL,17,Fmay have mounted the pavement, hit a
OL,18,Fbus stop shelter and then struck
OL,19,Fscaffolding.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
