OL,3,GNEWSAEight people injured after car
OL,4,A'mounts pavement' in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said: "Emergency
OL,7,Fservices are at the scene and drivers
OL,8,Fare urged to avoid the area."
